{
  "name": "robot_edits",
  "kind": "item",
  "sources": [
    "A small robot of a sculptor, 0.95 m high: not a real machine. A model of plan 0010: a body on two legs from edits, with the bones of a person of World.",
    "It shows the words of an edit: a crop (the round corners of the head), a hard blend (the hips, the pack, the points of the shoulders), the shapes wedge (the brow, the feet), prism (the pack, the hands) and pyramid, a finish for each edit (paint, steel, brass), a glow (the eyes, the lamps), a paint with a raise (the groove, the rivets) and a paint with an opacity (the rust)."
